rXiv/Crossref endpoints. citeturn21view8turn22view2\n\n  Line 690: Для portable Desktop integration это недостаточно.\n\n  Line 692: **Решение A — integration matrix:**\n\n  Line 700: Python:\n\n  Line 717:   agents discovery\n\n  Line 729:   providers canary\n\n  Line 748:         CHILD[Child/Subagent Sessions]\n\n  Line 754:         API[harness.run / dispatch / status / cancel]\n\n  Line 810: OpenCode уже предоставляет native subagents/child sessions и agent-level permissions; использовать это как execution substrate проще и безопаснее, чем повторно реализовывать модель permissions внутри Harness. citeturn25view0turn26view2\n\n  Line 824:     Waiting --> Validating: agent result\n\n  Line 856:   \"schema\": \"harness-dispatch/1.0\",\n\n  Line 866:     \"provider\": \"...\",\n\n  Line 887: agents/*.md\n\n  Line 888: → .opencode/agent/*.md\n\n  Line 894: .opencode/agents/*.md\n\n  Line 897: и рекомендуют `permission` вместо legacy `tools`. citeturn22view5turn25view0turn26view2\n\n  Line 902: agents/\n\n  Line 909: version-correct OpenCode agent definitions\n\n  Line 912: Нельзя делать `agents/*.md` одновременно source-of-truth и host-specific configuration.\n\n  Line 916: Для code-changing agents я бы использовал два уровня:\n\n  Line 1005:     agentDiscovery: boolean\n\n  Line 1038: harness_dispatch\n\n\n(Results are truncated: showing first 200 results. Consider using a more specific path or pattern.)"}], "metadata": {"matches": 200, "truncated": true}}, "time": {"created": 1791990468108, "ran": 1791990468122, "completed": 1791990468451}}], "snapshot": {"start": "1765fd4c0e0aa8b0755dc2a14507be3eecdeb181", "end": "1765fd4c0e0aa8b0755dc2a14507be3eecdeb181", "files": []}, "finish": "tool-calls", "providerState": {"responseId": "resp_0f05ab37e548106a016acf9ac68a5087d2af195606c27f8c13", "serviceTier": "default"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"input": 224240, "output": 269, "reasoning": 103, "cache": {"read": 0, "write": 0}}}}
